{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2023-02-15 08:30:00', 'title': 'NARRATIVE PARTNERS WITH EQUIFAX TO ENABLE EASY CUSTOMIZATION OF DIFFERENTIATED FINANCIAL DATASETS', 'text': "AUTOMOTIVE BUSINESSES CAN NOW USE NARRATIVE TO CREATE CUSTOM CUTS OF SELECT EQUIFAX AUDIENCE SEGMENTS NEW YORK , FEB. 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 NARRATIVE , THE WORLD'S LEADING DATA COLLABORATION PLATFORM, TODAY ANNOUNCED A PARTNERSHIP WITH EQUIFAX , A GLOBAL DATA, ANALYTICS AND TECHNOLOGY COMPANY, TO STREAMLINE ACCESS TO AND ACTIVATION OF UNIQUE WEALTH, ECONOMIC AND CREDIT-BASED AUDIENCE DATA FROM EQUIFAX FOR AUTOMOTIVE BUSINESSES. THE PARTNERSHIP IS DESIGNED TO GIVE MARKETING AND ANALYTICS TEAMS THE ABILITY TO CREATE CUSTOM SEGMENTS FROM EQUIFAX DATASETS AND DELIVER THEM TO ACTIVATION ENDPOINTS WITH JUST A FEW CLICKS."}